Aim
To carry out DC, Transient, and AC analysis of a Common Source amplifier using LTSpice, and to determine the key performance parameters of the circuit.

Components Required

• 	TSMC 180 nm NMOS transistor (CMOSN)

• 	TSMC 180 nm PMOS transistor (CMOSP)

• 	Source resistor

• 	Voltage sources (3 units)


